      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No conozco a este Goomy",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200063006F006E006F007A0063006F002000610020006500730074006500200047006F006F006D00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te vas a meter en problemas si es tuyo.\nSolo quiero llegar al fondo de esto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Goomy!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10047006F006F006D007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque no sea tu Pokémon, parece que\nse llevan muy bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E0071007500650020006E006F002000730065006100200074007500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065000A007300650020006C006C006500760061006E0020006D007500790020006200690065006E002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muy bien, hagamos una cosa. Si de verdad no\nes tu Goomy, supongo que no te importará<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmostrarme los Pokémon que llevas hoy, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En pocas palabras, quiero desafiarte\na un combate, así los veo de cerca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Combates muy bien, eso hay que admitirlo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006200610074006500730020006D007500790020006200690065006E002C002000650073006F00200068006100790020007100750065002000610064006D0069007400690072006C006F002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, ahora es cuando por fin admites\nque el Goomy sí es tuyo, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Goomy! ¡Te he dicho mil veces que no te vayas\ntú solo por ahí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10047006F006F006D00790021002000A10054006500200068006500200064006900630068006F0020006D0069006C00200076006500630065007300200071007500650020006E006F002000740065002000760061007900610073000A007400FA00200073006F006C006F00200070006F007200200061006800ED002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goooo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006F006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además, dejaste la banca toda pegajosa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100640065006D00E10073002C002000640065006A00610073007400650020006C0061002000620061006E0063006100200074006F0064006100200070006500670061006A006F00730061002E002E002E00100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Listo! ¡Quedó muy limpia! ¡Goomy, vámonos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006900730074006F0021002000A1005100750065006400F30020006D007500790020006C0069006D0070006900610021002000A10047006F006F006D0079002C0020007600E1006D006F006E006F0073002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya... Era verdad que no era tuyo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002E002E002E0020004500720061002000760065007200640061006400200071007500650020006E006F00200065007200610020007400750079006F002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdón, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. Últimamente hay tanto\nPokémon salvaje en la ciudad que me siento<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nobligada a intentar solucionar enseguida<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncualquier problema que me encuentre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como disculpa, permíteme que te dé un consejo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi quieres que Goomy llegue a su evolución final,\ntendrás que usar la lluvia a tu favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eso es todo, disculpa las molestias.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073006F00200065007300200074006F0064006F002C002000640069007300630075006C007000610020006C006100730020006D006F006C006500730074006900610073002E001000020114002B0000",
